  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "碩士論文",
    "sub_ename": "MASTER THESIS",
    "describe_ch": "碩士論文為水利系大學部重要之必修科目，在研一依專長或興趣選擇指導教授，在碩士班課程期間進行指定題目之實驗研究、撰寫論文及發表審查。學生經過專題實驗訓練，可學習到研究方法論、實驗設計技巧、數據分析、論文撰寫及口頭發表經驗。",
    "describe_eh": "Mater thesis is required for graduate students with zero credit. In the first year, students choose advisor by their research interesting. Advisor then assigns a research topic for students to work with. The training includes experiments, data collection, methodology, experimental design, data analysis, thesis writing, and defense.\r\n\r\n",
